# Python lint tools, pinned. Regenerate the locked, hashed tools/requirements-lint.txt with:
#   uv pip compile tools/requirements-lint.in --universal --python-version 3.12 --generate-hashes --exclude-newer <a date a week back> -o tools/requirements-lint.txt
# --universal resolves for every platform (with markers), so a lock made on macOS installs on the
# Linux CI runner too; CI runs Python 3.12.
